{"id":"98fd04960cd9e05e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmMRow.md","title":"FmMRow","display":"FmMRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmMRow","parameters":["z49","z50","z51"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmMRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z49</span><span>z50</span><span>z51</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>z49</code>、<code>z50</code>、<code>z51</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmMRow z49 z50 z51)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z51 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z54 (and (@ Nat z54) (@ PAtom z54 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z55\n          (and (@ PNeg z55 t) (exists z56 (exists z57 (and (in z56 z50) (and (@ App z49 z56 z57) (= z57 z55)))))))\n        (or\n          (exists z58\n            (exists z59\n              (and\n                (@ PImp z58 z59 t)\n                (and\n                  (exists z60 (exists z61 (and (in z60 z50) (and (@ App z49 z60 z61) (= z61 z58)))))\n                  (exists z62 (exists z63 (and (in z62 z50) (and (@ App z49 z62 z63) (= z63 z59)))))))))\n          (or\n            (@ PBot t)\n            (exists z64\n              (and (@ PBox z64 t) (exists z65 (exists z66 (and (in z65 z50) (and (@ App z49 z65 z66) (= z66 z64)))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d00664d192427d28\" href=\"?note=d00664d192427d28\" title=\"ZFC_PBox\">PBox</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FmMRow z49 z50 z51)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PAtom"